// CACHE: GET /repos/{owner}/{repo}/commits | owner=CodeEditorLand | repo=Vine | per_page=5 | page=18 → GET /repos/{owner}/{repo}/commits.RESPONSE.map(Author,Date,File,Message,SHA)
